---
description: Project rules for Cursor — defer to AGENTS.md
alwaysApply: true
---
Read and follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root before making changes.

- Implement from the handoff file in `docs/handoffs/` when one exists; do not widen scope.
- Never touch `.env*`, secrets, production resources, or deploy anything.
- Run lint, typecheck, and tests before declaring done.
- If blocked after two honest attempts, write `docs/handoffs/<task>-blocked.md` using `docs/handoffs/_TEMPLATE.md` (sections: tried, errors, hypotheses) and stop so Claude can take over.
